{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "密祖願文刻於戊戌冬。　諸大士願文并\n券語，辛丑五月，壽光法姓從　吳，自周安\n石居士處得來，亦時節因緣，珠還合浦之\n意，因全刻於帙。時辛丑重九契，穎述"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "袁了凡居士親書手卷真蹟現存，古梅菴比丘契穎摹梓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誤作目，從南改正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當作深"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疑當作深"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疑有誤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南作王、舊作丑，疑當作五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南作王、舊\n作丑，疑有誤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南舊作無量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幾葉幾行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南作無量、舊作諸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "親書手卷徑山古梅菴珍藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "親筆血書現存徑山古某庵，馮祭酒夢禎血書一通文同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雞園"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乘風"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開墾十居八九，今獨禁僧而置\n商民於度外，誠所謂放飯流歠而問無齒決也。其害在彼不在此。為今之鎖鎖不"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下四編，己亥年酉月望，從忍可師伯處得來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下七編，辛丑年正月，虞山錢牧翁發來刻入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "足下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下一十八編，己亥年酉月望，從忍可師伯處得來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下八編，辛丑年正月，虞山錢牧翁發來刻入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即監\n寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本寺\n　欽蒙\n慈聖宣文明肅皇太后\n賜畫像觀音大士一軸，紫衣一襲，每年十一月十九\n　日恭遇\n皇太后聖節，及\n今上聖節、冬節、年節，住持當遵奉\n　南京禮部劄付，及\n　本府帖文內事理，陳像披衣祝\n賀。尋常務要珍藏保護，不許披展玩褻。如住持闕則\n　禪堂首座代披行禮。首座并缺，則監寺代披行禮。\n　凡住持、首座、監寺重換，須交收明白。至囑。\n　時\n皇明萬曆己丑五月朔旦道開續筆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昭"}
